WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,140
Bear, insert the shelf into the wall

2
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:10,460
Not bad. The hotel is getting better and better under my management.

3
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,460
It would be better with some flowers

4
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:19,750
If you don't go out in the afternoon, you don't have to kill zombies and get gold, okay?

5
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:22,750
No, we'll leave tomorrow. We still have some unfinished tasks.

6
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:25,040
The card is for you, say whatever you want

7
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:27,040
Boss 666

8
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:32,960
Do you understand? The boss is not even curious about where we are going?

9
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:34,960
Don't even ask when we will come back

10
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,960
Isn't this a private matter of the guests?

11
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:39,960
Boss Xia is different. Can I ask?

12
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:42,960
You can ask Boss Xia anything you want.

13
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:43,960
not interested

14
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:47,910
We'll go to Shangyang Base tomorrow and we'll probably stay there for half a month.

15
00:00:47,910 --> 00:00:49,910
No thank you
